// 07 — 35 distinct named vector locals in one function scope.  Expect the
// active-store watermark to climb to ~35 (one live store per local until
// scope exit) and trip the LOFT_STORES=warn threshold.  Benign-baseline for
// 'function holds many legit locals'.  @P393.
fn main() {
  total = 0;
  a0: vector<integer> = [0, 1]; total += a0[0];
  a1: vector<integer> = [1, 2]; total += a1[0];
  a2: vector<integer> = [2, 3]; total += a2[0];
  a3: vector<integer> = [3, 4]; total += a3[0];
